<title>SOUTH KOREA: Samsung Display Devices H1 net falls.</title>
<headline>Samsung Display Devices H1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>	  (in billion won unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (won)				 2,283  vs 3,345</p>
<p>    Net					 60.76  vs 83.57</p>
<p>    Profit before tax		     71.91  vs 96.18</p>
<p>    Revenue				1,232.71  vs 1,181.42</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures were released by the Korea Listed Companies Association.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5648</p>
</text>
